---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About | Enterprise IT Fixes" description="A practical reference library of enterprise IT troubleshooting guides, built around common issues and linked vendor sources.">
  <div class="page"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'About'}]} /><p class="eyebrow">About this project</p><h1 class="page-title">Practical notes for solving IT problems.</h1><p class="page-lead">Enterprise IT Fixes collects troubleshooting topics, error messages, and useful technical references in one searchable library for IT administrators.</p>
    <div class="about-grid section"><section class="about-card"><h2>Built to help with similar issues</h2><p>Each article organizes a problem pattern into useful checks, possible causes, and troubleshooting steps. Use it as a guideline when you encounter similar symptoms; the right diagnosis can differ between environments.</p></section><section class="about-card"><h2>Original explanations, linked sources</h2><p>The articles are written in our own words and point to vendor documentation and other relevant references. Source links let you check the original instructions, product scope, and current details.</p></section><section class="about-card"><h2>Careful changes</h2><p>Some steps inspect logs or configuration; others may change access, policy, or service behavior. Gather evidence first, follow your organization’s change process, and confirm that a suggested step fits your setup.</p></section></div>
    <section class="info-panel"><h2>Suggest a correction</h2><p>There is no account system, comment box, newsletter, or contact form on this site. If a technical statement needs correction, use the public repository's issue tracker.</p><a class="button" href="https://github.com/mantha0007-cell/enterprise-it-fixes/issues">Open a repository issue</a></section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
